.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH kakashi-report 1  "report " 
.SH NAME
kakashi\-report \- Render the executive/machine\-readable report (§41)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBkakashi report\fR [\fB\-\-state\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIID\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Render the executive/machine\-readable report (§41)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-state\fR \fI<STATE>\fR [default: .]
Directory containing (or to contain) the `.kakashi/` state directory (§34)
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: human]

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
human
.IP \(bu 2
json
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIID\fR]

